  "notes": "Adds a fixture-first, no-networl HydroIdentityBridge contract and validator that preserves current NHDPlus HR identifiers and legacy COMIDs as distinct source-native families. It binds source releases, temporal basis, finite outcomes, and a JoinReceipt reference without activating sources, mutating lifecycle state, promoting, releasing, or publishing."
